{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24850","headline":"九日陪樊尚书龙山宴集 · 杨衡","name":"九日陪樊尚书龙山宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孟嘉从宴地，千乘复登临。\n缘危陟高步，凭旷写幽襟。\n黄花翫初馥，翠物喜盈斟。\n云杂组绣色，乐和山水音。\n斾摇秋吹急，筵卷夕光沈。\n都人瞻骑火，犹知隔寺深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}